  'ls.e_keep.intro': '<p>Without captures, <b>the seeds on your side are likely to be yours at the end</b> — they are an asset.</p><p>Moves that circulate seeds <b>within your own side</b> are often stronger than big moves that pour seeds onto the opponent\'s side.</p>',
