  'lc.basic': 'The three basics', 'lc.basic.d': 'Sowing, extra turns and captures: the three moves everything is built on.', 'lc.tactics': 'Winning techniques', 'lc.tactics.d': 'Defence, chains of extra turns and endgame counting for real games.',
  'lc.kOpen': 'Openings and tempo', 'lc.kOpen.d': 'Opening lines for 4 and 6 seeds (deep engine analysis) and waiting moves that give nothing away.', 'lc.kMid': 'Middlegame and endgame plans', 'lc.kMid.d': 'Extra turns into captures, hoarding on the right, starving the opponent, counting the endgame (exact).',
